<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2004 bond yields 5.97 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2004 bond yields 5.97 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/93</p>
<p>bond was announced by the State Treasury Office  SUVL:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-03-2004</p>
<p> COUPON:				 9.50 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			5.97 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  120.20</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,350 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 2,677 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 928 million markka at a price of 119.75 and a yield of 6.07 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 38,873 million markka</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
